      <div type="clause" n="1.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 1.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt is ðonne, ðæt nan man oðrum ryhtes ne wyrne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Now his concern is that no man shall withhold from another his rights.</ab>
